'''Green Strike''' (グリーンパワー, ''Gurīn Pawā'', '''Green Power''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

==Effect==
Deploy Cost Down (XL): [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers']] deploy costs are reduced by 20%.

==Requirement==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Green Strike|Deploy Cost Down (XL)|Goggles Cat|jpname=グリーンパワー|restriction=Only [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]]}}
}}

==Trivia==
*Green Strike, [[Blue Strike (Combo)|Blue Strike]] and [[Pink Strike (Combo)|Pink Strike]] are the first XL [[Cat Combo|Combos]] to not include any collab units.

